# Cortex (generated cache — do not commit)
# The embeddings store is the exception: it is force-tracked so CI runs
# offline against a committed fixture. `.cortex/` alone would exclude the
# directory itself, which git will not let a later `!` pattern re-include
# (a parent-directory exclusion always wins) — so the base pattern excludes
# only the directory's CONTENTS, letting the embeddings negation below work
# for any new or renamed file under it, not just the one currently tracked.
.cortex/*
!.cortex/embeddings/
